Measurement builds of the SD card storage, for the simulator only. They are
not part of the plugin. tools/build_sim.sh applies this to a copy of plugin/
for its sd-fwrite, sd-nobatch and sd-compact builds, which then set:

  -DFR_SD_FATFS_WRITES=1  every write through f_write and f_sync, waiting for the card
  -DFR_SD_BATCH_EVENTS=0  each event written at once instead of about once a second
  -DFR_SD_SPREAD=0        FLIGHT.DAT's three parts packed together instead of 4 MiB apart

With none of them set, the patched plugin works as the plain one.

